ile_name": "4.png", "id": "1456135952195027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_1456135955528360_8269696740259358682_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VbF-4_FsQusQ7kNvwHFfF5-&_nc_oc=Adp2L8RTFCDylCc4y9SRiBno9YpMfGzQe7m039ovguimkcr7HT9LrLKbk8SGqvpGOAQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ85iGdB6WJwLMOtr9-_kp3mOT_ROPE5VWbAD33X-OF-A&oe=6AEB50F0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SportsVRX - All in 1 Sports Games", "keywords": ["Sports", "Fitness", "Golf", "Basketball", "Tennis"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual arena with SportsVRX - All in 1 Sports Games, where your favorite sports come to life in one immersive package! Whether you're aiming for a perfect putt, serving aces, or going for a slam dunk, SportsVRX delivers realistic, physics-driven gameplay that feels just like the real thing.\n\nChallenge yourself or friends across five thrilling sports:\n\nTable Tennis \u2013 Fast-paced rallies with ultra-responsive paddle control.\n\nGolf \u2013 Hit the fairways and master your swing on beautifully rendered courses.\n\nTennis \u2013 Engage in intense rallies with precise racket mechanics.\n\nBadminton \u2013 Test your reflexes with fast shuttle action and smooth movement.\n\nBasketball \u2013 Shoot hoops, dribble, and dunk with intuitive controls and dynamic courts.\n\nWhether you're playing solo, training your skills, or competing in multiplayer modes, SportsVRX gives you a complete virtual sports club right in your headset. Perfect for all skill levels, with easy-to-pick-up mechanics and deep gameplay for pros.\n\nGet ready to move, sweat, and have a blast SportsVRX is your all access pass to nonstop VR sports action!", "short_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual arena with SportsVRX - All in 1 Sports Games, where your favorite sports come to life in one immersive package! Whether you're aiming for a perfect putt, ser